nes change; normalized AST equality passes.\n- [ ] Runtime strings, constants, fixtures, decorators, assertions, and executable statements remain unchanged.\n- [ ] The ordered shebang/directive inventory remains byte-identical.\n- [ ] Each edited docstring is shorter and removes repetition, history, ornament, or obvious narration.\n- [ ] A non-author reviewer posts one leaf-linked TSV row per edited docstring with immutable before/final citations, preserved contract/consumer, before/after words, and both verdicts.\n- [ ] Every TSV row records `semantic-preservation=PASS` and `bloat-removal=PASS`; missing or failing rows block closure.\n- [ ] The normalized guard, focused collection, comment-hygiene check, path-scoped `git diff --check`, and worktree-venv `make verify` pass.\n\n## Verification\nRun the recorded normalized-AST/directive guard; collect the seven named rehearsal tests; run `scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`; run path-scoped `git diff --check`; and run `make verify`. The independent TSV is authoritative for prose quality.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/external/live_jira_cloud_s3/_cloud_s3_support.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/external/live_jira_cloud_s3/conftest.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/external/live_jira_cloud_s3/test_cloud_s3_rehearsal.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["parent","2d43-3c39-307e-4450"],["relates_to","4994-06e7-12fe-4498"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2d43-3c39-307e-4450","parent_status_uuid":"1ee0ec3d-8612-4ac3-a011-8a4823ae4c9c","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress